@startuml component-architecture
!theme plain
title Core-plus-satellite plugin split (ADR-0020)

package "Dev10x (core plugin)" {
  [cli MCP server\n(~90 tools, name-stable)] as CLI
  [db MCP server] as DB
  [hooks/ (14 scripts)] as HOOKS
  [src/dev10x package] as PKG
  [shared references/] as REFS
  [shared agents/] as AGENTS
  [orchestration + session skills] as ORCH
  [audit / permission / maintenance skills] as AUDIT
}

package "Satellites (plugins/<area>/)" {
  [Dev10x-Comms\nslack*, gchat* + comms-expert] as COMMS
  [Dev10x-Infra\nk8s, aws-vault + infra-expert] as INFRA
  [Dev10x-Testing\npy-test*, playwright, qa-self] as TEST
  [Dev10x-Data\ndb, db-psql] as DATA
  [Dev10x-Tickets\njira, linear, ticket-*, scope*] as TICKETS
  [Dev10x-Git\ngit, git-*] as GIT
  [Dev10x-GitHub\ngh-*, review*] as GH
}

HOOKS --> PKG
CLI --> PKG
DB --> PKG

COMMS ..> CLI : mcp__plugin_Dev10x_cli__*\n(implicit dependency:\ncore must be installed)
INFRA ..> CLI
TEST ..> CLI
DATA ..> DB
TICKETS ..> CLI
GIT ..> CLI
GH ..> CLI

note bottom of COMMS
  Migration order (lowest coupling first):
  comms -> infra -> testing -> data
  -> tickets -> git -> github
end note
@enduml
